   "text": "KEY FORMULAS\nM_KV = 2 * L * B * T * H_kv * d_h * S\nLlama-3-8B: 2*32*8*128*2 = 128 KiB/tok ; 8K = 1 GiB\ntoy 7B (L32,Hkv8,dh64): 64 KiB/tok ; 100K = 6.55 GB\npool = 0.9*HBM - W - overhead ; TPOT >= (W + B*KV)/BW",
   "originalText": "KEY FORMULAS\nM_KV = 2 * L * B * T * H_kv * d_h * S\nLlama-3-8B: 2*32*8*128*2 = 128 KiB/tok ; 8K = 1 GiB\ntoy 7B (L32,Hkv8,dh64): 64 KiB/tok ; 100K = 6.55 GB\npool = 0.9*HBM - W - overhead ; TPOT >= (W + B*KV)/BW",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
