   "text": "KEY FORMULAS\ndecode AI ~ H_q/H_kv : MHA 1 | GQA-8 4 | MQA 32 (ridge ~200)\nLlama-3-8B KV/tok: MHA 512 | GQA-8 128 | MQA 16 KiB\nWq 4096x4096, Wk=Wv 4096x1024, g = 32/8 = 4\nK_g = mean(K_i), uptrain ~5% ; TP > H_kv => replicate KV",
   "originalText": "KEY FORMULAS\ndecode AI ~ H_q/H_kv : MHA 1 | GQA-8 4 | MQA 32 (ridge ~200)\nLlama-3-8B KV/tok: MHA 512 | GQA-8 128 | MQA 16 KiB\nWq 4096x4096, Wk=Wv 4096x1024, g = 32/8 = 4\nK_g = mean(K_i), uptrain ~5% ; TP > H_kv => replicate KV",
