   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "KEY FORMULAS\ncache = d_c + d_R = 512 + 64 = 576 /tok/layer (1.76% of MHA)\nMHA 2*128*128 = 32,768 ; MLA = GQA with 2.25 groups\nabsorb: c_Q^T (W_UQ_i^T W_UK_i) c_KV_j ; W_UV -> W_O\nscale 1/sqrt(128+64) ; decode AI ~ 242 ; V2 128K: 8.44 GiB",
   "originalText": "KEY FORMULAS\ncache = d_c + d_R = 512 + 64 = 576 /tok/layer (1.76% of MHA)\nMHA 2*128*128 = 32,768 ; MLA = GQA with 2.25 groups\nabsorb: c_Q^T (W_UQ_i^T W_UK_i) c_KV_j ; W_UV -> W_O\nscale 1/sqrt(128+64) ; decode AI ~ 242 ; V2 128K: 8.44 GiB",
