   "text": "Why base 500,000 in Llama-3?\nlambda_63: 54.4K (base 1e4) -> 2.56M tokens (base 5e5)",
   "originalText": "Why base 500,000 in Llama-3?\nlambda_63: 54.4K (base 1e4) -> 2.56M tokens (base 5e5)",
