   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "KEY FORMULAS\nP = min(P_peak, AI*BW) ; ridge = P_peak/BW\ntoy 100T/500GB/s -> 200 ; A100 ~200 ; H100 ~295\nGEMM AI ~ B ; attention AI ~ H_q/H_kv (independent of B)\nFP8 KV: AI x2 ; window 128K->8K: bytes /16 ; A100->H100 BW x2.15",
   "originalText": "KEY FORMULAS\nP = min(P_peak, AI*BW) ; ridge = P_peak/BW\ntoy 100T/500GB/s -> 200 ; A100 ~200 ; H100 ~295\nGEMM AI ~ B ; attention AI ~ H_q/H_kv (independent of B)\nFP8 KV: AI x2 ; window 128K->8K: bytes /16 ; A100->H100 BW x2.15",
