   "text": "KEY FORMULAS\npool = 0.9*HBM_total - W - workspace\n70B 128K: 42.95 GB/seq ; 414.8/42.95 = 9 (FP8: 19)\norder: fit W -> fit KV -> TPOT -> throughput\ngoodput = requests meeting both TTFT and TPOT SLOs",
